Educational Use License
========================

This repository is provided for educational use as part of a Business
Intelligence capstone course at SRH University of Applied Sciences.

Code in this repository (src/, app/, and supporting scripts) may be reused,
modified, and extended freely by enrolled students for coursework purposes.

The dataset referenced by this project (DataCo Smart Supply Chain for Big Data
Analysis) is not owned by the authors of this repository. It remains subject to
its original license from Mendeley Data:

    Constante, Fabian; Silva, Fernando; Pereira, Antonio (2019),
    "DataCo SMART SUPPLY CHAIN FOR BIG DATA ANALYSIS", Mendeley Data, V5,
    doi: 10.17632/8gx2fvg2k6.5

All rights to the raw data remain with the original authors. This project does
not redistribute the raw dataset within the git repository itself; it is fetched
at setup time via `src/download_data.py` from its public source.
